{"type":"json_object","message":"The reserve for product warranties was $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005, per post_text segment q11. The change is calculated as the 2006 reserve minus the 2005 reserve, in millions: 10 - 4.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"reserve_2006 - reserve_2005","variables":{"reserve_2006":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"million"},"reserve_2005":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"million"}},"sources":{"reserve_2006":"source:q11n3","reserve_2005":"source:q11n4"}}}